item 1 measure is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/1/measure".

item 1 measure is an assessment statement.

item 1 measure has for "cav:interpretation" the resource "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#InterpretationPositive".

item 1 measure has the judgement "-EU DP database of DG GROW or eLicencings system from DG SANTE, or DG TRADE (to be confirmed by ITCB based on future Business Case)
-Customer verification will leverage the European Business Wallets to authenticate and identify economic operators and public sector bodies across borders, while ensuring interoperability. In addition, the use of the European Business Wallets can be extended to the exchange of credentials (e.g., eLicences and eCertificates) and to the streamlining of reporting obligations.".

item 1 measure has the statement type "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#StatementTypeAlignmentMeasure".

item 1 measure has the description "Alignment with existing digital and sectorial policies".

item 1 measure has the title "Licensing, registration prior notification platform, customer verification and administrative cooperation platform".


