item 2 measure has the judgement "-Art. 4 Free Movement
-Chapter 2, in particular obligations of operators
-Chapter 4, cooperation with and tasks of national authorities".

item 2 measure has the statement type "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#StatementTypeOrganisationMeasure".

item 2 measure has the description "Organisational measures for a smooth cross-border digital public services delivery".

item 2 measure has the title "Licensing, registration prior notification platform, customer verification and administrative cooperation platform".


